@startuml
title How CMTAT calls the RuleEngine (transfer / mint / burn)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

|CMTAT|
start
:1. transfer, mint or burn call;
if (2. RuleEngine set?\n(RuleEngine != address(0))) then (true)
  |RuleEngine|
  :3. transferred(from, to, value)\n(reverts if the transfer is not authorised);
  |CMTAT|
else (false)
endif
:9. rest of the code\n(ERC-20 update, balance / allowance checks, ...);
:10. end of execution;
stop
@enduml
